>Which should I build up?  Since I don't know what Grayswander does
>I don't know if I should use it.  It's +5 now, while my Excal. is
>only +1.  Should I build up my Excalibur or keep building the Gray-
>swander?

The real quick and easy answer is Excalibur- try enchanting Grayswander again
will make it go "poof" (or at least this is VERY likely).

>It seems to "burn the skin" of certain creatures.  Namely: manes,

Grayswandir is a silver saber and as such does extra damage to were-creatures
and minor (and major?) demons. It's +5 to hit, +0 damage. It also prevents
hallucination.

Excalibur is +5 to hit, +10 damage. Prevents level drain and has automatic
searching.

Basically pick the weapon for the fight (and preferably BEFORE the fight, not
during it!)
